Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.22,0:22:55.20,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Rin here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.72,0:22:59.36,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan is going to English school.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.58,0:23:04.37,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Wake up! Daikichi, you are late.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.48,0:23:07.65,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,But Daikichi looks tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.13,0:23:12.03,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,On the train ride back home, he's always snoring like an engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.49,0:23:14.58,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if it's hard at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.51,0:23:18.43,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,The next story is "Daikichi's Decision."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.43,0:23:19.68,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't miss it!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:57.88,0:01:01.14,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ashita no koto wa wakannai
Dialogue: 4,0:01:01.14,0:01:04.56,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kore tte gisei to wa chigau
Dialogue: 4,0:01:04.56,0:01:06.26,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nanika ga chigau
Dialogue: 4,0:01:06.26,0:01:09.88,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}batsu ge-mu ja nante omowanai
Dialogue: 4,0:01:09.88,0:01:13.13,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}de nande na no ka wa wakannai
Dialogue: 4,0:01:13.13,0:01:16.53,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}chotto shakuzen to shinai kedo
Dialogue: 4,0:01:16.53,0:01:22.08,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kimi no sonzai ima daiji da nante mon ja nai
Dialogue: 4,0:01:22.58,0:01:28.34,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}owaranai koto nante kono yo no doko ni mo nai
Dialogue: 4,0:01:29.45,0:01:32.89,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}naku no wa tsurain ja nai no
Dialogue: 4,0:01:32.89,0:01:35.59,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ai no Sweet Drops, Sweet Drops
Dialogue: 4,0:01:35.59,0:01:39.03,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}zutto yume mite itai ne
Dialogue: 4,0:01:39.03,0:01:42.16,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}motto yasashiku shitai ne
Dialogue: 4,0:01:42.55,0:01:45.92,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kimi to iraretara Happy
Dialogue: 4,0:01:45.92,0:01:49.14,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}onna no ko tte tsuyoi ne
Dialogue: 4,0:01:49.14,0:01:52.45,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}dakedo tokidoki yowai ne
Dialogue: 4,0:01:52.81,0:01:59.14,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}bokura no negai wa Happy Happy Happy
Dialogue: 4,0:01:59.14,0:02:02.58,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}sonna hibi mo Happy
Dialogue: 4,0:02:06.02,0:02:10.29,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy
Dialogue: 4,0:00:57.88,0:01:01.14,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}We don't know what'll happen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:01.14,0:01:04.56,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This feels different from a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:04.56,0:01:06.26,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Something feels different.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:06.26,0:01:09.88,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm not thinking of it as a punishment game.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:09.88,0:01:13.13,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I still don't know why.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:13.13,0:01:16.53,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though I don't quite feel satisfied with that,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:16.53,0:01:22.08,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}there's no question that you're important to me now.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:22.58,0:01:28.34,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}There's nothing in this world that's endless.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:29.45,0:01:32.68,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Isn't it painful having to cry?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:32.89,0:01:35.48,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Love's sweet drops, sweet drops.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:35.59,0:01:39.03,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to keep dreaming forever?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:39.03,0:01:42.16,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to be kinder?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:42.55,0:01:45.92,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}As long as I'm with you, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:45.92,0:01:49.14,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you think girls can be strong?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:49.14,0:01:52.45,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though we can be weak sometimes.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:52.81,0:01:59.14,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our wish is for happy, happy, happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:59.14,0:02:02.58,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Those days can also be happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:06.02,0:02:10.29,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:38.95,0:20:43.44,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nichiyou no hareta hirusagari
Dialogue: 4,0:20:44.11,0:20:46.97,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kyou wa doko e yukou?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:49.37,0:20:53.93,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kayoi nareta itsumo no michi ga
Dialogue: 4,0:20:53.93,0:20:58.53,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mabushiku kagayaite mieru
Dialogue: 4,0:20:59.66,0:21:03.88,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}terasu atatakai taiyou to
Dialogue: 4,0:21:04.90,0:21:08.96,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}tonari ni kimi ga ireba
Dialogue: 4,0:21:08.96,0:21:13.04,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mou High High High
Dialogue: 4,0:21:13.63,0:21:18.91,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}hashagidasu kimochi ni
Dialogue: 4,0:21:19.27,0:21:23.48,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 4,0:21:24.12,0:21:29.79,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe wa dokomademo
Dialogue: 4,0:21:29.79,0:21:33.95,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mou High High High
Dialogue: 4,0:21:34.61,0:21:39.57,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}maiagaru kaze ni nori
Dialogue: 4,0:21:40.26,0:21:44.43,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 4,0:21:44.95,0:21:53.49,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe mo tobihaneru
Dialogue: 4,0:20:38.95,0:20:43.44,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}It's a sunny Sunday, early in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:44.11,0:20:46.97,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Where should we go today?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:49.37,0:20:53.93,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This path I've grown so used to taking
Dialogue: 4,0:20:53.93,0:20:58.53,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}seems to be shining brightly,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:59.66,0:21:03.88,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}as long as the warm sun is shining
Dialogue: 4,0:21:04.90,0:21:08.96,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}and you are here beside me.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:08.96,0:21:13.04,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:13.63,0:21:18.91,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I feel like frolicking about.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:19.27,0:21:23.48,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:24.12,0:21:29.79,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our voices can go anywhere.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:29.79,0:21:33.95,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:34.61,0:21:39.57,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm riding on the rising wind.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:40.26,0:21:44.43,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:44.95,0:21:53.49,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even our voices will be bouncing.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:00.52,0:00:04.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Futon, clothes, shoes, toothbrush?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:05.56,0:00:07.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What else?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:07.11,0:00:07.77,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:12.70,0:00:14.95,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Don't disappear on me all of a sudden!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:14.95,0:00:16.66,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You startled me!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:16.66,0:00:17.78,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:20.04,0:00:22.62,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, get a green one.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:34.34,0:00:36.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Come on! Let's go.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:42.02,0:00:44.14,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's dangerous if we don't hold hands.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:47.52,0:00:48.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,For me?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:34.46,0:02:36.34,Main Dialog,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,I want blue!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:37.97,0:02:41.47,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Were there always this many parents with their kids here?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:42.93,0:02:44.06,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I want that!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:49.23,0:02:50.39,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:50.39,0:02:51.15,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:51.15,0:02:54.82,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Umm... Okay. Sure, why not?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:55.73,0:02:57.40,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,About what size are you?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:57.40,0:02:58.32,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I dunno.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:02.82,0:03:04.66,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, turn around.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:07.33,0:03:08.45,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Like this?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:10.62,0:03:12.00,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What am I supposed to match it to?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:12.00,0:03:13.38,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I dunno!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:13.38,0:03:15.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't flap your arms!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:15.21,0:03:16.75,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What else do you wear?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:16.75,0:03:20.67,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Pajamas! Underwear! Shirts! Socks!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:28.97,0:03:30.68,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need a skirt?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:31.14,0:03:32.98,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All you've got are pants.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:32.98,0:03:35.69,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Skirts aren't allowed at nursery school.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:36.23,0:03:38.19,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:42.70,0:03:44.95,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nursery school?!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:45.37,0:03:47.49,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It slipped my mind!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:47.49,0:03:49.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow's Monday!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:53.33,0:03:56.63,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, I'm tired!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:56.63,0:03:59.92,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We're almost there, so don't give up.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:59.92,0:04:01.38,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:01.92,0:04:04.14,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:04.14,0:04:07.26,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be home in a minute, so...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:07.26,0:04:09.01,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:14.10,0:04:15.94,Main Dialog Italic,Woman's voice,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}You useless bum!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:15.94,0:04:19.32,Main Dialog Italic,Man's voice,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}You always bring me crap I don't need!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:19.32,0:04:21.03,Main Dialog Italic,Man's voice,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}I'm gonna lose my temper!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:21.03,0:04:23.24,Main Dialog Italic,Woman's voice,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}You bastard!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:26.16,0:04:26.99,Main Dialog Italic,Man's voice,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Hey!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:26.99,0:04:28.95,Main Dialog Italic,Woman's voice,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:28.95,0:04:30.49,Main Dialog Italic,Woman's voice,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Let go of me!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:30.49,0:04:32.66,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, excuse me...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:32.66,0:04:35.37,Main Dialog,Haruko's mother-in-law,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, this is the Maeda residence.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:35.37,0:04:40.09,Main Dialog,Haruko's mother-in-law,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, please accept my condolences \Nover your sudden loss.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:40.09,0:04:42.88,Main Dialog,Haruko's mother-in-law,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, please wait a moment...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:42.88,0:04:46.30,Main Dialog,Haruko's mother-in-law,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko-san, it's Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:46.30,0:04:49.39,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, okay. Thank you!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:50.72,0:04:52.73,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Haruko?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:52.73,0:04:54.98,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I didn't know your cell number.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:54.98,0:04:56.15,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:56.15,0:04:59.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Tell me, how do you register \Nfor nursery school?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:00.07,0:05:01.57,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Nursery school...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:03.32,0:05:06.41,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You really did take Rin-chan home?!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:07.07,0:05:09.37,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:09.37,0:05:11.04,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,For now...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:11.33,0:05:13.70,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean, "for now"?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:13.70,0:05:17.37,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,So, anyway, I can't \Ntake off work tomorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:17.37,0:05:19.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of procedures need to be followed?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:19.46,0:05:22.67,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Look, you can't just get accepted instantly.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:22.67,0:05:24.13,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Can you do something on your end?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:24.13,0:05:26.26,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What can I do?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:26.72,0:05:29.51,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,For starters, I'd consult with the city office...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:29.51,0:05:31.56,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's Sunday night.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:32.14,0:05:33.22,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:33.22,0:05:35.39,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing, it's over here.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:33.22,0:05:35.73,Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, is that Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:35.39,0:05:36.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:35.73,0:05:37.19,Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:36.44,0:05:37.52,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, please!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:37.52,0:05:39.44,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,This is important!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:38.44,0:05:39.83,Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:40.06,0:05:42.94,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,There's an emergency temporary nursery school...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:42.94,0:05:45.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Emergency temporary nursery school...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:44.15,0:05:45.57,Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:45.57,0:05:47.32,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:47.32,0:05:49.24,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What? Dai-chan?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:47.82,0:05:51.74,Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! Rin-chan! Rin-chan! Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:49.24,0:05:50.95,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing, it's over here.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:51.83,0:05:54.29,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm almost done, so wait!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:54.29,0:05:55.54,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I hate waiting!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:55.54,0:05:58.17,Main Dialog,Haruko's mother-in-law,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko-san, I'm going to turn off the miso soup.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:58.17,0:05:59.79,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! Thank you.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:59.79,0:06:03.05,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey... It sounds like you're busy, so I'll call back later...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:02.04,0:06:04.30,Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 4,0:06:09.26,0:06:11.68,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Man, there are hardly any of them...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:12.05,0:06:14.74,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,So, my commute time is suddenly doubled...?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:15.14,0:06:19.19,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Yeah. I'm good.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:19.40,0:06:23.32,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This one's pretty close, but I can't get out of the office by six...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:22.15,0:06:23.65,Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let's play again.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:23.65,0:06:27.44,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Bye-bye, Reina-chan. Talk to you later!
Dialogue: 4,0:06:30.24,0:06:32.24,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This looks like a good one,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:32.24,0:06:35.24,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but they accept kids on an emergency basis for only 10 days...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:36.08,0:06:37.25,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bath...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:39.67,0:06:41.33,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Just wait a little longer...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:57.89,0:07:01.65,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Daikichi!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:01.98,0:07:04.06,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's morning...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:05.61,0:07:07.94,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... Sorry...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:15.12,0:07:17.54,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you sleep here?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:19.62,0:07:22.04,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The futon is weirdly warm.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:23.46,0:07:24.92,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Take this off!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:26.30,0:07:28.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:33.84,0:07:36.22,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,About the nursery school we're going to today...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:44.10,0:07:45.94,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for the food!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:44.10,0:07:45.94,Alt,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for the food.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:48.65,0:07:51.07,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're not supposed to eat with your elbow on the table!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:51.95,0:07:53.78,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There. Sorry.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:00.33,0:08:04.08,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, the nursery school you're going to today is only temporary.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:04.08,0:08:05.29,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Temporary?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:05.29,0:08:08.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Only until we find a place that will officially let you attend.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:08.96,0:08:11.26,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's "officially"?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:16.97,0:08:19.47,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It means like, "for real"...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:20.43,0:08:22.06,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Or, not quite...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:23.73,0:08:25.77,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind {\i1}my{\i0} hair!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:31.32,0:08:32.86,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:33.82,0:08:35.28,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:47.00,0:08:48.54,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:48.54,0:08:50.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,F-Fine...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:54.59,0:08:55.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I see it!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:56.64,0:08:58.55,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Put me down! Put me down!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:59.85,0:09:01.68,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What? What?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:02.06,0:09:05.06,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Would you be embarrassed if other kids saw me carry you or something?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:15.15,0:09:16.57,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:17.61,0:09:18.87,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:25.12,0:09:27.83,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, please take good care of her.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:27.83,0:09:30.04,Main Dialog,Nursery Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Sure. We'll see you later.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:51.86,0:09:54.69,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't look at me like that!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:55.19,0:09:57.49,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I won't be able to make it back while it's still light out,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:57.49,0:09:59.53,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but I'll come as fast as I can.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:00.45,0:10:01.62,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I promise.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:06.08,0:10:08.29,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Pinky swear.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:08.29,0:10:09.92,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If I lie, I swear
Dialogue: 4,0:10:09.92,0:10:13.13,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll swallow 1000 needles...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:13.13,0:10:15.13,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:15.13,0:10:16.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,My finger was cut off!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:17.76,0:10:19.59,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's not how the song goes!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:22.01,0:10:24.18,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, see ya! Wait for me here, Rin.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:29.60,0:10:31.02,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Rin.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:31.77,0:10:34.36,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't take your feelings into consideration.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:35.61,0:10:39.95,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You had nothing to do with your mother's circumstances or Grandpa's lifespan,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:39.95,0:10:46.79,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,and yet you were left behind with the lonely reality.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:48.04,0:10:50.79,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you think I was going \Nto leave you behind too?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:53.17,0:10:55.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:55.21,0:10:57.01,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll never let that happen to you again...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:07.85,0:11:09.14,Main Dialog,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Read it to me.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:10.85,0:11:11.90,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:31.57,0:11:34.71,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san. Wanna get some lunch?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:35.21,0:11:37.13,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I brought this.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:37.13,0:11:39.17,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I need to leave a little early today...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:39.38,0:11:42.76,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah? Then I'll see you in a bit.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:43.39,0:11:45.55,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Working really hard from the beginning of the month, huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:48.02,0:11:49.68,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:02.24,0:12:04.16,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Take a photo of this sample.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:04.16,0:12:04.87,Main Dialog,Woman Employee,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:04.87,0:12:08.74,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san! You've got a call from outside line #4 about the private viewing.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:08.74,0:12:10.45,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Coming.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:11.00,0:12:13.54,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, this is Kawachi.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:24.34,0:12:26.05,Main Dialog,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:26.05,0:12:27.47,Main Dialog,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:27.47,0:12:28.97,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:30.77,0:12:32.68,Main Dialog,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Let's keep going!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:32.68,0:12:33.52,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:41.53,0:12:43.40,Main Dialog,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:43.40,0:12:45.16,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Excuse me...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:49.79,0:12:51.66,Main Dialog,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,You're late!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:51.66,0:12:54.12,Main Dialog,Father,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about that. Go and put your regular clothes on.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:54.12,0:12:55.25,Main Dialog,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:00.84,0:13:03.05,Main Dialog,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, don't break it, okay?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:03.05,0:13:03.88,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:03.88,0:13:05.30,Main Dialog,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:08.10,0:13:09.22,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:16.44,0:13:19.48,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,{Kawachi-san, let's grab some dinner.}{edit: this was in script but isn't audible}
Dialogue: 4,0:13:20.02,0:13:23.03,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, please wait one moment.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:23.03,0:13:24.36,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:24.36,0:13:27.66,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,It's Miyata-san from Mitsutomo Trading.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:29.28,0:13:30.95,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hand it over...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:31.62,0:13:33.62,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, this is Kawachi.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:33.62,0:13:35.58,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for your patronage.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:49.01,0:13:50.85,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, Kawachi here.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:51.68,0:13:52.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:53.27,0:13:55.39,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:55.39,0:13:58.73,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. I'll be able to leave my company in a few more minutes, so...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:58.73,0:14:00.19,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:41.40,0:14:45.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This nursery school is so far!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:56.70,0:14:59.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Sorry I'm late!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:05.09,0:15:06.55,Main Dialog,Nursery Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:07.17,0:15:09.93,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really... sorry.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:11.13,0:15:11.97,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:21.48,0:15:22.77,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Are those potatoes?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:22.77,0:15:24.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,They look delicious.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:24.44,0:15:25.90,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's burdock!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:36.62,0:15:39.33,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I swallowed
Dialogue: 4,0:15:42.67,0:15:44.63,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,1000 needles!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:15.49,0:16:17.45,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Please take care of this.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:19.49,0:16:21.29,Main Dialog,Kurohige,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san! I need your signature!
Dialogue: 4,0:16:54.86,0:16:57.12,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Not like I need to worry,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:57.12,0:16:59.53,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but what'll happen if I get a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:08.29,0:17:11.84,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Daikichi!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:11.84,0:17:13.42,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:14.84,0:17:17.26,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay... Sorry...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:18.01,0:17:21.85,Main Dialog,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi, this is what you sent out yesterday, isn't it?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:24.23,0:17:26.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:26.69,0:17:29.02,Main Dialog,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,It's unusual for you...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:29.02,0:17:30.94,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:30.94,0:17:33.28,Main Dialog,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,I already apologized to the recipient, so...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:33.28,0:17:35.49,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. I'll call them.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:39.28,0:17:42.16,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,We haven't gone out drinking in a while. What do you say?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:42.16,0:17:44.33,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, tonight's no good.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:44.33,0:17:46.08,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Then, how about tomorrow?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:46.67,0:17:48.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I've got something tomorrow, too...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:51.25,0:17:54.80,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I get it! Good for you, you sly dog.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:15.49,0:18:16.49,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:19.11,0:18:20.82,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 4,0:18:34.50,0:18:35.80,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 4,0:18:35.80,0:18:37.30,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 4,0:18:53.06,0:18:56.28,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Run away from the moon!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:30.14,0:19:31.98,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There's no end!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:36.19,0:19:39.78,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How long can I keep up this lifestyle?
Dialogue: 4,0:19:49.20,0:19:50.79,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,These are Rin-chan's.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:51.37,0:19:53.71,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,This is all she has,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:53.71,0:19:56.88,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,but her Maternal and Child Health Handbook and important documents are in here.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:58.21,0:19:59.88,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Even if it's only for a short period of time,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:59.88,0:20:03.51,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,raising a child is a very difficult thing.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:03.51,0:20:06.22,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's Rin who has it the most difficult...
Dialogue: 4,0:20:07.47,0:20:11.23,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. I'm just gonna take a peek...
Dialogue: 4,0:20:16.27,0:20:17.94,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's got the same mouth...
Dialogue: 4,0:20:20.57,0:20:26.03,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All the relatives are talking about you like you're some foul villain.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:26.45,0:20:28.95,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But I wonder what the truth is...
Dialogue: 4,0:20:29.62,0:20:30.83,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Masako-san.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:09.84,0:22:10.97,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:10.97,0:22:12.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Feel bad somewhere?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:13.06,0:22:15.98,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, you're sleeping over there now...
Dialogue: 4,0:22:24.23,0:22:26.19,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,M-Me?! Me?!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:29.32,0:22:30.70,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's sweat!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:38.29,0:22:42.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, sure... It's sweat, sweat...
Dialogue: 4,0:22:42.21,0:22:44.42,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Help me take the sheet off.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:44.42,0:22:46.42,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I said it's sweat!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:46.42,0:22:48.55,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm saying it's sweat too, aren't I?!
